# The fat jar under flezha-sdk/dist/ and the native binaries under
# flezha-sdk-native/src/main/resources/native/ are build output, ignored by the
# root .gitignore. There is deliberately no `!` re-including them here: a nested
# .gitignore outranks the root one, and this file used to re-include the jar.
